sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant P as Pipeline
    participant J as Cloudflare judge (Granite)
    participant S as Cloudflare summarizer (GLM)
    participant DB as SQLite
    U->>API: POST /api/sessions (upload JSON)
    API->>DB: insert session + messages (version 0)
    API->>P: compact(messages, settings)
    P->>P: pin task, user messages, latest turn, errors
    par one request per 16k tokens
        P->>J: state + yes/no questions (temperature 0)
        J-->>P: {"scores": {"t3": 0.0, "t7": 1.0, …}}
    end
    alt invalid JSON
        P->>J: retry once
        J-->>P: still invalid → JudgeError → plain-summary fallback
    end
    P->>P: keep / truncate / drop, store full text for recall
    opt still over budget
        P->>S: summarize oldest unpinned turns
        S-->>P: bullet lines
        P->>J: is each line supported by the tool outputs?
        J-->>P: scores → unsupported lines removed
    end
    P-->>API: result (status, tokens, decisions, neurons)
    API->>DB: insert run (version n) + decisions
    U->>API: POST /runs/{id}/items/{item}/restore
    API->>DB: new version with the item back verbatim ("Restored")
